---
// UUIDv7 (RFC 9562) 128-bit Binary Layout Diagram Component
---

<figure class="u7-diagram" aria-labelledby="u7-diagram-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG layout (ViewBox 820x220, spacious layout, large fonts) -->
  <svg
    class="u7-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 820 220"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="u7-diagram-title u7-diagram-desc"
  >
    <title id="u7-diagram-title">UUIDv7 (RFC 9562) 128-bit 二進位結構圖</title>
    <desc id="u7-diagram-desc">
      展示 48-bit Unix 毫秒時間戳、4-bit 版本號 (0111)、12-bit
      隨機/計數序列號、2-bit 變體 (10) 與 62-bit 隨機熵的完整二進位拓撲分佈。
    </desc>

    <!-- Top Total Bit Bar -->
    <g transform="translate(20, 25)">
      <rect width="780" height="28" rx="6" class="u7-diagram__total-bar"></rect>
      <text class="u7-diagram__total-text" x="390" y="19" text-anchor="middle">
        128-bit 標準 UUID (16 Bytes) ➔ 嚴格時間單調遞增 ＋ 全域零協調去中心化
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Bit Segments Grid (Y: 65, Height: 115, Bottom padding to 220 is 40px) -->
    <!-- Segment 1: 48-bit Timestamp -->
    <g transform="translate(20, 65)">
      <rect
        width="270"
        height="115"
        rx="8"
        class="u7-diagram__seg u7-diagram__seg--green"></rect>
      <text
        class="u7-diagram__seg-badge u7-diagram__seg-badge--green"
        x="135"
        y="26"
        text-anchor="middle">48 BITS</text
      >
      <text
        class="u7-diagram__seg-title u7-diagram__seg-title--green"
        x="135"
        y="56"
        text-anchor="middle">Unix 毫秒時間戳</text
      >
      <text class="u7-diagram__seg-label" x="135" y="82" text-anchor="middle"
        >unix_ts_ms (時間有序)</text
      >
      <text
        class="u7-diagram__seg-highlight"
        x="135"
        y="103"
        text-anchor="middle">消除 B+ Tree 頁分裂</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Segment 2: 4-bit Ver -->
    <g transform="translate(295, 65)">
      <rect width="80" height="115" rx="8" class="u7-diagram__seg"></rect>
      <text class="u7-diagram__seg-badge" x="40" y="26" text-anchor="middle"
        >4 BITS</text
      >
      <text class="u7-diagram__seg-code" x="40" y="58" text-anchor="middle"
        >0111</text
      >
      <text class="u7-diagram__seg-label" x="40" y="85" text-anchor="middle"
        >版本號</text
      >
      <text class="u7-diagram__seg-sub" x="40" y="103" text-anchor="middle"
        >UUID v7</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Segment 3: 12-bit Sequence -->
    <g transform="translate(380, 65)">
      <rect
        width="140"
        height="115"
        rx="8"
        class="u7-diagram__seg u7-diagram__seg--blue"></rect>
      <text
        class="u7-diagram__seg-badge u7-diagram__seg-badge--blue"
        x="70"
        y="26"
        text-anchor="middle">12 BITS</text
      >
      <text
        class="u7-diagram__seg-title u7-diagram__seg-title--blue"
        x="70"
        y="56"
        text-anchor="middle">隨機計數</text
      >
      <text class="u7-diagram__seg-label" x="70" y="82" text-anchor="middle"
        >sub-ms / seq</text
      >
      <text
        class="u7-diagram__seg-highlight"
        x="70"
        y="103"
        text-anchor="middle">毫秒內防碰撞</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Segment 4: 2-bit Var -->
    <g transform="translate(525, 65)">
      <rect width="75" height="115" rx="8" class="u7-diagram__seg"></rect>
      <text class="u7-diagram__seg-badge" x="37" y="26" text-anchor="middle"
        >2 BITS</text
      >
      <text class="u7-diagram__seg-code" x="37" y="58" text-anchor="middle"
        >10</text
      >
      <text class="u7-diagram__seg-label" x="37" y="85" text-anchor="middle"
        >變體位</text
      >
      <text class="u7-diagram__seg-sub" x="37" y="103" text-anchor="middle"
        >RFC 9562</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Segment 5: 62-bit Random Entropy -->
    <g transform="translate(605, 65)">
      <rect
        width="195"
        height="115"
        rx="8"
        class="u7-diagram__seg u7-diagram__seg--purple"></rect>
      <text
        class="u7-diagram__seg-badge u7-diagram__seg-badge--purple"
        x="97"
        y="26"
        text-anchor="middle">62 BITS</text
      >
      <text
        class="u7-diagram__seg-title u7-diagram__seg-title--purple"
        x="97"
        y="56"
        text-anchor="middle">密碼級隨機熵</text
      >
      <text class="u7-diagram__seg-label" x="97" y="82" text-anchor="middle"
        >CSPRNG 偽隨機數</text
      >
      <text
        class="u7-diagram__seg-highlight"
        x="97"
        y="103"
        text-anchor="middle">全域無協調防重複</text
      >
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile vertical layout -->
  <div class="u7-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="u7-mobile-card u7-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="u7-mobile-badge u7-mobile-badge--green"
        >01. 48-BIT UNIX TIMESTAMP</span
      >
      <h4>Unix 毫秒時間戳 (最高位)</h4>
      <p>
        採用 UTC 毫秒數佔據最高 48
        位元，確保字串與二進位排序完全吻合時間先後，徹底修復資料庫 B+ Tree
        頁分裂難題。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="u7-mobile-card">
      <span class="u7-mobile-badge">02. 4-BIT VER (0111)</span>
      <h4>UUID Version 7 標識</h4>
      <p>
        固定二進位值為 0111，宣告符合 RFC 9562 規範的最新時間有序 UUID 標準。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="u7-mobile-card u7-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="u7-mobile-badge u7-mobile-badge--blue"
        >03. 12-BIT SUB-MS / SEQUENCE</span
      >
      <h4>毫秒內隨機計數序列</h4>
      <p>
        在高併發同毫秒內遞增或生成隨機數，確保同一毫秒產生的大量 ID
        依然維持單調遞增且不碰撞。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="u7-mobile-card u7-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="u7-mobile-badge u7-mobile-badge--purple"
        >04. 62-BIT RANDOM ENTROPY</span
      >
      <h4>62 位元隨機熵 (去中心化保證)</h4>
      <p>
        由密碼學安全偽隨機數生成器（CSPRNG）填充，完全不需像 Snowflake 那樣協調
        Worker ID，全球任一節點皆可獨立發號。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="u7-diagram-caption">
    圖：UUIDv7 (RFC 9562) 128-bit 結構 —— 48-bit 時間戳有序性 ＋ 62-bit
    隨機熵去中心化
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .u7-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .u7-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .u7-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Base Tokens */
  .u7-diagram__total-bar {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .u7-diagram__total-text {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .u7-diagram__seg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .u7-diagram__seg-badge {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .u7-diagram__seg-code {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 800;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .u7-diagram__seg-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .u7-diagram__seg-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .u7-diagram__seg-sub {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .u7-diagram__seg-highlight {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  /* Color Variations */
  .u7-diagram__seg--green {
    stroke: #16a34a;
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.05);
  }
  .u7-diagram__seg-badge--green {
    fill: #16a34a;
  }
  .u7-diagram__seg-title--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-diagram__seg--green {
    stroke: #4ade80;
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.12);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-diagram__seg-badge--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-diagram__seg-title--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .u7-diagram__seg--blue {
    stroke: #3b82f6;
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05);
  }
  .u7-diagram__seg-badge--blue {
    fill: #3b82f6;
  }
  .u7-diagram__seg-title--blue {
    fill: #2563eb;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-diagram__seg--blue {
    stroke: #60a5fa;
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-diagram__seg-badge--blue {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-diagram__seg-title--blue {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .u7-diagram__seg--purple {
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.05);
  }
  .u7-diagram__seg-badge--purple {
    fill: #8b5cf6;
  }
  .u7-diagram__seg-title--purple {
    fill: #7c3aed;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-diagram__seg--purple {
    stroke: #a78bfa;
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-diagram__seg-badge--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-diagram__seg-title--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  figcaption {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Mobile Breakpoint (≤ 48rem / 768px) */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .u7-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .u7-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .u7-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.875rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .u7-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
    }
    .u7-mobile-card--blue {
      border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
    }
    .u7-mobile-card--purple {
      border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;
    }

    .u7-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    }

    .u7-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #86efac;
    }

    .u7-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #3b82f6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #93c5fd;
    }

    .u7-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #8b5cf6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .u7-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #c4b5fd;
    }

    .u7-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .u7-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  }
</style>
